	measure ShortQtyGrowthRate = ```
			
			VAR PreviousYearShortQty = 
			    CALCULATE(
			        [ShortQtyonly],
			        SAMEPERIODLASTYEAR('Calendar'[Date])
			    )
			
			VAR CurrentYearShortQty = 
			    [ShortQtyonly]
			
			VAR GrowthRate = 
			    IF(
			        PreviousYearShortQty > 0,
			        DIVIDE(CurrentYearShortQty - PreviousYearShortQty, PreviousYearShortQty),
			        BLANK()
			    )
			
			RETURN 
			IF(
			    NOT ISBLANK(GrowthRate),
			    MAX(-0.5, MIN(GrowthRate, 0.5)),
			    BLANK()
			)
			```
		lineageTag: 9024294d-9053-4400-a1a8-89020aadf5a8

